f-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418881#post1418881\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"> I was the world's biggest Setite fan and everyone knows the Path of Corruption was x1000 better as a Discipline than the Setites' &quot;Signature&quot; discipline.<br /> .</div> </div> </div> </div>How long ago was that? Given that you seem to not see the glaring problems with the Ministry/Church split, and dislike the power of the dark father, I find it hard to believe that you were a fan within the last decade.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T13:50:58-07:00","id":1418888,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418885#post1418885\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Uh, no, that's not how it works.<br /> <br /> You're good at Blood Sorcery and Vicissitude. Just not good at Protean (which serves as the basis for Vicissitude).</div> </div> </div> </div>Ok, you had it weighted more to protean, my bad (tho the Quietus issue still stands for the Bani) y<br /> From what you had written, I assumed you meant for viscittutude to be a replacement set of powers of sorcery to impose Protean changes on other people, and to expand what Protean could do for everyone.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T14:16:04-07:00","id":1418889,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418887#post1418887\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">How long ago was that? Given that you seem to not see the glaring problems with the Ministry/Church split, and dislike the power of the dark father, I find it hard to believe that you were a fan within the last decade.</div> </div> </div> </div>he likes the Setites, and likes the Anarchs, Ministry are both, so he likes Ministry<br /> <br /> Dawkins' favorite clan is Setites, and his favorite sect was Anarchs, so he made the Ministry<br /> <br /> hmm...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T14:20:51-07:00","id":1418891,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418889#post1418889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> he likes the Setites, and likes the Anarchs, Ministry are both, so he likes Ministry<br /> <br /> Dawkins' favorite clan is Setites, and his favorite sect was Anarchs, so he made the Ministry<br /> <br /> hmm...</div> </div> </div> </div><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/19YUQc3.gif?noredirect\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> <br /> edit: <br /> -----I don't think that's threadcrapping, but just in case: <br /> But now there aren't setties. Everything I liked about them is a gross parody of them. <br /> I feel a good portion of things I don't like about V5 is that a lot of the changes seem to be.... things people wanted to happen. <br /> <br /> Not things that should or would happen. Things people want to happen. The writers are finally eating the cake, and leave nothing for the readers.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":".  Concerned I was threadcrapping. 10-18-2020, 05:27 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T14:45:54-07:00","id":1418893,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">It was underpowered and inflexible with a few cool powers. Don't pretend otherwise.</div> </div> </div> </div>LOL! You mean the Discipline that let you literally become a God? You mean the discipline that let you create your own monsters entirely? The same one that let you remove your heart so you were OPly unstakeable? The one that let you breath out pure heated sand at people? As the namesake, let you deal heavily with Snakes and turn into- to the point at the highest levels of it you can turn into a near indestructible large shadow snake-demon? Protean isn't even as HALF as interesting than Serpentis. There was NO reason for it to be replaced other than some sort of misplace dislike of it instead of seeing how it thematically fit the Setites and how interesting it was. How can you be a Follower of Set fan but dislike Serpentis lol.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 10-18-2020, 05:50 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T14:51:40-07:00","id":1418894,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418891#post1418891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Not things that should or would happen. Things people want to happen. The writers are finally eating the cake, and leave nothing for the readers.</div> </div> </div> </div>if I had to describe v5, I'd compare it to MtA Revised,<br /> they nuked the Archmages (Meths, Elders),<br /> weakened the powers (though mages were still very good, nowhere as weak as vampires are now),<br /> they nuked the umbra for more street-level action (V5 is less global level, and more city level),<br /> they interrupted the Ascension War and declared the traditions losers (the jyhad seems over, though the gehenna crusade is a thing. and the sabbat have collapsed)<br /> <br /> considering the Mage devs backtracked that time, I wonder if how long v5 will hold its position<br /> <br /> <br /> on a side note, I don't mind the writers writing what they want to,<br /> not that I dislike being pandered to, but writers writing their own vision is fine by me<br /> <br /> I sort of disliked the blandness of v20, so I can appreciate the change of attitude in v5<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>-</b>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10998-pleiades","name":"Pleiades","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar10998_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1844"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:00:11-07:00","id":1418901,"title":"","content":"<b>How I'd update the Tzimisce to V5</b><br /> <br /> <b>Disciplines</b>: Animalism, Blood Sorcery, and Protean<br /> <br /> <b>Clan Bane</b>: Tzimisce have to have the soil of their homeland (or soil from New York or Transylvania) or they must roll a second time for Hunger Dice every night. A Tzimisce without native soil is thus potentially constantly hungry and dangerous. I think they should also have something that makes them suffer from a distraction and lack of empathy from mortals if they make a Bestial Failure. Perhaps make it harder for them to avoid stains due to their detachment from morality and coldness.<br /> <br /> <b>Current Status</b>: At some point, they started taking Ruthven seriously and captured their Elder with the help of Vykos and Beckett. As such, the Tzimisce determined their Antediluvian was still alive and had transcended the state of vampiredom to become something else. Some Tzimisce were incensed by this and threw themselves into the Gehenna War to lower their Generation and gain power to hunt the creature while others sought arcane solutions.<br /> <br /> A few ordered others to infiltrate the Camarilla and Anarchs to maintain their survival. Others, under Vykos' direction have reached out across the world to the Ashirra, Laibon, Inconnu, Russian Council, and Wan Kuei Tzimisce in order to increase their ability to deal with this threat. The Old Clan and Modern Tzimisce have since made peace and now acknowledge only a single clan. Sect now means little to the Tzimisce who are Tzimisce first and members of whatever their current organization is second. Old grudges still remain but they hold fast to the codes of conduct that predate all the current sects.<br /> <br /> <b>Anarch Tzimisce</b>: Anarch Tzimisce are rarely followers. They have set themselves up as Lords of former Sabbat domains, small towns, and crossroads that they hold absolutely. They are not a clan who serves and tend to have a small force of enhanced ghouls to serve as their gang. The Vinculum is employed among these Anarchs and while a few have Tzimisce &quot;knights&quot;, these Barons (called &quot;Voivoides&quot;) are often more traditional than most. The Anarchs tend to find these gangs of football pads, swords, and shotgun-wielding warriors a bit silly but don't turn down their aid.<br /> <br /> <b>Camarilla Tzimisce</b>: Camarilla Tzimisce are far smaller in number than the Lasombra defectors but exist. Many of the younger ones include plastic surgeons, healers, Masquerade protectors, and those who exist to help compromised Kindred escape the Second Inquisition. These flesh sculptors serve a valuable purpose in the Modern Nights of instagram and cellphone cameras. Few Tzimisce are Princes but many have since become Seneschals, Sheriffs, and Scourges. The exception are the Far East and Eastern European Camarilla where they rule as they always have.<br /> <br /> <b>Blood Cults Tzimisce</b>: The Tzimisce tend to be drawn to the Church of Caine, Bahari, and other traditionalist Cainite religions. The Path of Metamorphosis has suffered in recent years due to the revelation the Eldest follows it. As such, its members have either turned to worship their Antediluvian or been forced to repudiate their Path. The Church of Mithras appeals to some despite its gods' Ventrue origins as does the Nephilim among the Dracon's lineage. Some have also taken up worship of infernalism, particularly Kupala.<br /> <br /> <b>Sabbat Tzimisce</b>: Many expected the Tzimisce to take advantage of the Lasombra's weakness and seize control of the sect. Instead, the Tzimisce have done their best to keep the sect functioning from behind the scenes. Their defections and alliance with non-Sabbat Tzimisce are looked at with suspicion but those who were Archbishops before remain so as do Cardinals as well as Pricius. The Sabbat Tzimisce have begun researching powerful magic, WMD, and other tools that go well beyond the ability to kill normal elders.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps",