 themselves into the Gehenna War to gain Generation and power to hunt the creature while others sought arcane solutions.<br /> <br /> A few ordered others to infiltrate the Camarilla and Anarchs to maintain their survival. Others, under Vykos' direction have reached out across the world to the Ashirra, Laibon, Inconnu, Russian Council, and Wan Kuei Tzimisce in order to increase their ability to deal with this threat. The Old Clan and Modern Tzimisce have since made peace and now acknowledge only a single clan. Sect now means little to the Tzimisce who are Tzimisce first and members of whatever their current organization is second. Old grudges still remain but they hold fast to the codes of conduct that predate all the current sects.<br /> <br /> <b>Anarch Tzimisce</b>: Anarch Tzimisce are rarely followers. They have set themselves up as Lords of former Sabbat domains, small towns, and crossroads that they hold absolutely. They are not a clan who serves and tend to have a small force of enhanced ghouls to serve as their gang. The Vinculum is employed among these Anarchs and while a few have Tzimisce &quot;knights&quot;, these Barons (called &quot;Voivoides&quot;) are often more traditional than most. The Anarchs tend to find these gangs of football pads, swords, and shotgun-wielding warriors a bit silly but don't turn down their aid.<br /> <br /> <b>Camarilla Tzimisce</b>: Camarilla Tzimisce are far smaller in number than the Lasombra defectors but exist. Many of the younger ones include plastic surgeons, healers, Masquerade protectors, and those who exist to help compromised Kindred escape the Second Inquisition. These flesh sculptors serve a valuable purpose in the Modern Nights of instagram and cellphone cameras. Few Tzimisce are Princes but many have since become Seneschals, Sheriffs, and Scourges. The exception are the Far East and Eastern European Camarilla where they rule as they always have.<br /> <br /> <b>Blood Cults Tzimisce</b>: The Tzimisce tend to be drawn to the Church of Caine, Bahari, and other traditionalist Cainite religions. The Path of Metamorphosis has suffered in recent years due to the revelation the Eldest follows it. As such, its members have either turned to worship their Antediluvian or been forced to repudiate their Path. The Church of Mithras appeals to some despite its gods' Ventrue origins as does the Nephilim among the Dracon's lineage. Some have also taken up worship of infernalism, particularly Kupala.<br /> <br /> <b>Sabbat Tzimisce</b>: Many expected the Tzimisce to take advantage of the Lasombra's weakness and seize control of the sect. Instead, the Tzimisce have done their best to keep the sect functioning from behind the scenes. Their defections and alliance with non-Sabbat Tzimisce are looked at with suspicion but those who were Archbishops before remain so as do Cardinals as well as Pricius. The Sabbat Tzimisce have begun researching powerful magic, WMD, and other tools that go well beyond the ability to kill normal elders.</div> </div> </div> </div>i really like that!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4621-nicolas-milioni","name":"Nicolas Milioni","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4621_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3605"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:03:38-07:00","id":1418903,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418893#post1418893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> LOL! You mean the Discipline that let you literally become a God? You mean the discipline that let you create your own monsters entirely? The same one that let you remove your heart so you were OPly unstakeable? The one that let you breath out pure heated sand at people? As the namesake, let you deal heavily with Snakes and turn into- to the point at the highest levels of it you can turn into a near indestructible large shadow snake-demon? Protean isn't even as HALF as interesting than Serpentis. There was NO reason for it to be replaced other than some sort of misplace dislike of it instead of seeing how it thematically fit the Setites and how interesting it was. How can you be a Follower of Set fan but dislike Serpentis lol.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, Serpentis is by far the worst Discipline ever. &quot;I have a snake tongue, I can't be staked!&quot;<br /> <br /> Anything Serpentis could do, Protean could do but better.<br /> <br /> But I'm not going to convince you, so just take the view we disagree on its inherent lameness.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I apologize, arguing over which Discipline is cooler and more effective is chidlish. I'm glad Serpentis works for you. I've always admittedly put my Clan Disciplines in Presence and Obfuscate but that's me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-18-2020, 07:11 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:10:18-07:00","id":1418906,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Pleiades</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418889#post1418889\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> he likes the Setites, and likes the Anarchs, Ministry are both, so he likes Ministry<br /> <br /> Dawkins' favorite clan is Setites, and his favorite sect was Anarchs, so he made the Ministry<br /> <br /> hmm...</div> </div> </div> </div>A pretty good summary.<br /> <br /> I feel like the Anarchs had a severe problem that if they're just Gangrel, Caitiff, and Brujah then people think they're &quot;Idiot Sect&quot; because there's no brains. Add the Ministry to the Sect and suddenly you have people who are cunning planners, schemers, and leaders of cult. Yes, on their better days, the Brujah can fill this role but they don't have a Lasombra or Ventrue Clan that can really herd the cats necessary to TAKE OVER THE WORLD.<br /> <br /> For the Anarchs to compete against the Sabbat and Camarilla, they needed some genuine supervillain and diabolical mastermind types.<br /> <br /> The Ministry is overflowering with them and they've never had a sect they could actually put all that cunning and manipulation to use on.<br /> <br /> Hesha&gt;Jeremy MacNeil<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/odyVjzD.jpg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> I mean, are the Anarchs fucked?<br /> <br /> Oh, most definitely.<br /> <br /> The Anarchs will become Sabbat 2.0 under Ministry influence. I don't know how long it will take to get them all on inhuman evil Paths but it WILL HAPPEN.<br /> <br /> But it'll be a sweet ride until it happens.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-18-2020, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:12:37-07:00","id":1418907,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418903#post1418903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, Serpentis is by far the worst Discipline ever. &quot;I have a snake tongue, I can't be staked!&quot;<br /> <br /> Anything Serpentis could do, Protean could do but better.<br /> <br /> But I'm not going to convince you, so just take the view we disagree on its inherent lameness.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yes lets agree to disagree to same length of Protean and Blood Sorcery being useful or needed for the Tzimisce at all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:16:26-07:00","id":1418909,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418907#post1418907\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes lets agree to disagree to same length of Protean and Blood Sorcery being useful or needed for the Tzimisce at all.</div> </div> </div> </div>I don't dispute your right to hate it as much as I love the idea.<br /> <br /> But I admit, when I was 14 in 1994, all I could think of when I got Vampire was.<br /> <br /> &quot;MY VENTRUE KNOWS PROTEAN!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But...it's not a core power.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I want to become a bat and wolf and mist.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Gangrel...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't wear suits!&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:19:54-07:00","id":1418910,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418909#post1418909\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I don't dispute your right to hate it as much as I love the idea.<br /> <br /> But I admit, when I was 14 in 1994, all I could think of when I got Vampire was.<br /> <br /> &quot;MY VENTRUE KNOWS PROTEAN!&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;But...it's not a core power.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;I want to become a bat and wolf and mist.&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Gangrel...&quot;<br /> <br /> &quot;Don't wear suits!&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> .........LOL","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:30:58-07:00","id":1418912,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418891#post1418891\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">-----I don't think that's threadcrapping, but just in case:<br /> <br /> But now there aren't setties. Everything I liked about them is a gross parody of them.<br /> <br /> I feel a good portion of things I don't like about V5 is that a lot of the changes seem to be.... things people wanted to happen.<br /> <br /> Not things that should or would happen. Things people want to happen. The writers are finally eating the cake, and leave nothing for the readers.</div> </div> </div> </div>One of the interesting things about Revised was that they greatly expanded a lot of the concepts of the original V:TM clans. The Giovanni went from being a bunch of Italians and their families to having Aztec clans, American Jewish clans, and many other variations. The Followers of Set benefited from having a bunch of expansions too so there was an Aztec Bloodline, a Norse Bloodline, and so on to go with the Caribbean Bloodline. V5 seems to be following up on a lot of these conflicts and how these international groups might have problems with one another.<br /> <br /> For me, the CHURCH OF SET has the benefit of being everything the Old Followers of Set are. They're exactly like the WEB OF KNIVES in that if you want to play the most badass mutherfucker who ever lived who drinks the blood of the Unclean then you still have someone to follow in Ur-Shulgi's blood cult. You just don't associate that with Muslims anymore (and thus avoid the Unfortunate Implications). The Church of Set is all the &quot;God of Chaos, Lord of Storms&quot; Egyptian sexiness that existed beforehand but has decided to reign in the ecumenism of old to something that coincidentally increases their power base.<br /> <br /> The old stuff is still there but there's now MORE to play. You also have potential enemies to play off against and engage with if you're lacking storytelling. The Ministry can fight the Church of Set and the Church of Set can fight the Ministry. Or maybe you can ignore each other and attempt to do your own thing in the same city.<br /> <br /> I've made an embarrassing number of Lucita fanboy jokes because I based like 5 characters on her ala Drizzt Do'Urdem BUT if I had to say who my favorite character was in V:TM it would almost certainly be Modius....then Anita Wainwright BUT THEN Hesha. I've made like 4 characters based on him so he's only a little behind Moncada's childe. He's just the coolest bastard this side of the Nile and one of the genuinely scary people in the setting. His Clan Novel is my favorite of the entire setting.<br /> <br /> I actually made a pitch about writing a Anarch novel with him to Jason Carl.<br /> <br /> Him leading the Anarchs....well, that has possibilities. Also, I like the idea of him struggling with the Ancient Old Fogies in Egypt.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-18-2020, 07:33 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:35:09-07:00","id":1418913,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418893#post1418893\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> LOL! You mean the Discipline that let you literally become a God? You mean the discipline that let you create your own monsters entirely? The same one that let you remove your heart so you were OPly unstakeable? The one that let you breath out pure heated sand at people? As the namesake, let you deal heavily with Snakes and turn into- to the point at the highest levels of it you can turn into a near indestructible large shadow snake-demon? Protean isn't even as HALF as interesting than Serpentis. There was NO reason for it to be replaced other than some sort of misplace dislike of it instead of seeing how it thematically fit the Setites and how interesting it was. How can you be a Follower of Set fan but dislike Serpentis lol.</div> </div> </div> </div>And soak agg damage with vigor at dif. 6.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T16:47:00-07:00","id":1418914,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418903#post1418903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, Serpentis is by far the worst Discipline ever. &amp;quot;I have a snake tongue, I can't be staked!&amp;quot;<br /> <br /> Anything Serpentis could do, Protean could do but better.<br /> <br /> But I'm not going to convince you, so just take the view we disagree on its inherent lameness.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I apologize, arguing over which Discipline is cooler and more effective is chidlish. I'm glad Serpentis works for you. I've always admittedly put my Clan Disciplines in Presence and Obfuscate but that's me.</div> </div> </div> </div>Protean dont let you tank agg damage with vigor neither survive sunlight. Dont let summom minions, create obsession in someone with something (like suicide for ex) etc.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/24832-blailton","name":"blailton","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar24832_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2018"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"389"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T18:30:39-07:00","id":1418921,"title":"","content":"I'm a bit late to this discussion, but I see Vicissitude as a sort of stumbling block on the Path of Metamorphosis. The Path is about transcending the state of vampirism, but too many Tzimisce get caught up in the fleshy aspect and forget the spiritual aspect. This was touched on in BJD I think when Beckett was told how the Eldest was lost for a time (or something like that) but no more and now was going to consult with It's siblings.<br /> <br /> Or in other words, Vicissitude was supposed to be one means to an end, but thanks to its utilitarian uses, becomes the end in itself. As to why more Tzimisce get caught up in it... Maybe it's corruption of Kupala? Maybe it's the Eldest, using it to weed out the wheat from the chafe of the Clan? Maybe it's the all too human leftover in each vampire that seeks to shape and control their environment? Or maybe it really is an Umbral parasite.<br /> <br /> I guess what I'm getting at is Tzimisce don't need Vicissitude to be cool. Imagine the ingenuity (and lengths) a Metamorphosist would go to in order to fully embrace his philosophy without the ease (and that is the key, I think) Vicissitude offers? Vicissitude makes Azhi Dahaka easy, perhaps too easy. Transcendence shouldn't be easy.<br /> <br /> And to go back to the thread topic, I think Ravnos remnants should hold a special place within the Sabbat (not like what the Lasombra and Tzimisce were, but something to emulate, have in your Pack as a good luck charm, etc...). They are the one Clan that actually has no Antediluvian. Sure, it's not common knowledge, but astute Sabbat will notice none of them are experiencing the Beckoning.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":11149,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","user":"PJ123","date":". 10-18-2020, 09:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T22:56:41-07:00","id":1418939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>PJ123</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418921#post1418921\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a bit late to this discussion, but I see Vicissitude as a sort of stumbling block on the Path of Metamorphosis. The Path is about transcending the state of vampirism, but too many Tzimisce get caught up in the fleshy aspect and forget the spiritual aspect. This was touched on in BJD I think when Beckett was told how the Eldest was lost for a time (or something like that) but no more and now was going to consult with It's siblings.<br /> <br /> Or in other words, Vicissitude was supposed to be one means to an end, but thanks to its utilitarian uses, becomes the end in itself. As to why more Tzimisce get caught up in it... Maybe it's corruption of Kupala? Maybe it's the Eldest, using it to weed out the wheat from the chafe of the Clan? Maybe it's the all too human leftover in each vampire that seeks to shape and control their environment? Or maybe it really is an Umbral parasite.<br /> <br /> I guess what I'm getting at is Tzimisce don't need Vicissitude to be cool. Imagine the ingenuity (and lengths) a Metamorphosist would go to in order to fully embrace his philosophy without the ease (and that is the key, I think) Vicissitude offers? Vicissitude makes Azhi Dahaka easy, perhaps too easy. Transcendence shouldn't be easy.<br /> <br /> And to go back to the thread topic, I think Ravnos remnants should hold a special place within the Sabbat (not like what the Lasombra and Tzimisce were, but something to emulate, have in your Pack as a good luck charm, etc...). They are the one Clan that actually has no Antediluvian. Sure, it's not common knowledge, but astute Sabbat will notice none of them are experiencing the Beckoning.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are conflating Tzimisce with Metamorphosist, not all Tzim are on that path, ( hell I have never played one who is) Viscititude is body horror and possibly cosmic horror into a heady blend of cool, but they aren't all metamorphosis adherents. ( And I just love the body horror Voivode, on Death and the Soul, or even Honorable Accord, rending its servants, and enemies into forms that amuse it, while changing it's flesh to suit whim, or task)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-19-2020, 02:25 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T23:27:43-07:00","id":1418945,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418939#post1418939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You are conflating Tzimisce with Metamorphosist, not all Tzim are on that path, ( hell I have never played one who is) Viscititude is body horror and possibly cosmic horror into a heady blend of cool, but they aren't all metamorphosis adherents.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I'm going to ask the question that needs to be asked.<br /> <br /> WHY do people keep saying Vicissitude is freakish, monstrous, and evil?<br /> <br /> I mean, it seems like it would be a REALLY useful Discipline for the decidedly NON-cosmic horror professions of:<br /> <br /> * Surgeons<br /> * Plastic Surgeons<br /> * Masquerade Protectors<br /> * Trans<br /> * Cancer treatment<br /> * Faith Healers<br /> * Body-Builders<br /> <br /> I don't get why Vicissitude is being treated as the SCARYYYY inhuman discipline when it's not....really that scary or inhuman. I mean, it can be used for such but plenty of people would want it who aren't crazy serial killers.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-18T23:40:48-07:00","id":1418950,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418945#post1418945\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly, I'm going to ask the question that needs to be asked.<br /> <br /> WHY do people keep saying Vicissitude is freakish, monstrous, and evil?<br /> <br /> I mean, it seems like it would be a REALLY useful Discipline for the decidedly NON-cosmic horror professions of:<br /> <br /> * Surgeons<br /> * Plastic Surgeons<br /> * Masquerade Protectors<br /> * Trans<br /> * Cancer treatment<br /> * Faith Healers<br /> * Body-Builders<br /> <br /> I don't get why Vicissitude is being treated as the SCARYYYY inhuman discipline when it's not....really that scary or inhuman. I mean, it can be used for such but plenty of people would want it who aren't crazy serial killers.</div> </div> </div> </div>Because this is the WoD and the point is to find horror. And viscititude is the best discipline that allows you to explore body horror, Obtenebration was the best at Lovecraftian Cosmic horror (but that is now completely gone, replaced with Wraiths utterly boring maelstrom, which was a problem Wraith always had), Dominate is the nightmarish destruction of free will and identity, Presence is super rohypnol at its base, with the horror that implies, etc etc. Vampires are monsters, either honest ones transcending the chrysalis that was their humanity, or failed ones clinging to mortal identity, even those choices have their own horror.<br /> <br /> In short freakish, evil and inhuman is what is cool about it, and come on, turning that annoying ventrue into a tasteful chair that has no mouth but keeps trying to scream is flat out amusing.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-19-2020, 02:46 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T00:42:58-07:00","id":1418955,"title":"","content":"Why is vicissitude nasty? <br /> <br /> because you are attempting surgery with your fingers and there's no easy undo button. you are going to cause a lot of mistakes, and you are going to need a lot of 'practice materials' if you are to become anywhere near competent. humanity is going to suffer.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T01:32:17-07:00","id":1418963,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418912#post1418912\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> For me, the CHURCH OF SET has the benefit of being everything the Old Followers of Set are. They're exactly like the WEB OF KNIVES in that if you want to play the most badass mutherfucker who ever lived who drinks the blood of the Unclean then you still have someone to follow in Ur-Shulgi's blood cult. You just don't associate that with Muslims anymore (and thus avoid the Unfortunate Implications). The Church of Set is all the &quot;God of Chaos, Lord of Storms&quot; Egyptian sexiness that existed beforehand but has decided to reign in the ecumenism of old to something that coincidentally increases their power base..</div> </div> </div> </div>What don't you understand? <br /> The Followers of Set were never the Web of knives. I don't want to play 'The Web of Knives' The Setite equivelent of the WoK is the warrior caste. I want to play a priest of the Followers of Set. Only issue is V5 has disapeared 90% of the sect's ideology. Imagine a world where all mainstream political ideas have mysteriously gone and we can only choose to support Turbo-Nazis or a degenerate queer community that now accepts the kind of things actual queer communties have actively distanced themselves from. The Church is stupid, the Ministry is stupid. Most of the Settite appeal to me is that I get an awesome religion and I can do what I like with it. I can emphasize the parts I like, demphasize the parts I don't, and bullshit all the metaphors I can dream of. . With the Church, I can't do what I like with it. With the ministry, we don't have one great religion but a confederation of other, stupid, competitor religions and such a political alliance undermines the awesomeness of my own religion (because I'd be siding with people I fundamentally disagree with and want murdered) <br /> The Followers were so much better than the sum of their dysfunctional parts. <br /> <br /> And the CoS is just dumb<br /> And the Ministry as a reaction to the CoS is dumber. <br /> <br /> The Followers feel like you've got a functional, wonderful Gnostic religion. The split-factions are just dysfunctional and lack the Gnostic umbrella that was the backbone of the settite faith. The ministry needs to purge their heretics, and the Church needs to revert it's idiotic political strategy. Or we can just continue to pick and choose what parts we like of this new edition as if we were looting a hoarder's house...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T01:58:33-07:00","id":1418968,"title":"","content":"Also: The Ravnos Clan weakness (vice) defines them. It's what keeps them moving, and what draws them to their complicated relationship to humanity and the path of paradox. <br /> As unfortunate as their early writeup was, it should not ruin the future of the clan. They make for very compelling characters as cumpulsion drives them to being bastards, and it would be a shame to replace their clan weakness and deny them their defining trait.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T02:01:26-07:00","id":1418970,"title":"","content":"I thought the Ravnos were fixed by their Clan Book the same way as the Assamites were fixed.<br /> <br /> However, I'm not 100% against the idea that without their Antediluvian that the Clan ceases to be a Bloodline and gradually becomes Caitiff.<br /> <br /> If you're going to &quot;kill&quot; a Clan that wouldn't be the worst way.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T03:07:33-07:00","id":1418973,"title":"","content":"Someone earlier had some ideas for them, but I was too wrapped up by their settites comments to respond to the ravnos. <br /> remember that many of the DAV20 writers are working on V5. They allowed for ravnos 'virtues'. I like 'virtues' only when they're flawed enough to have you run yourself out of town. There's something so... narcisistic about a Ravnos with a clan weakness of 'virtue'. <br /> And of course, V5 has really shaken up the pot without concern for continuity and overkilled a bunch of stuff: The Nosferatu aren't that ugly, the Tremere weakness has been inverted, Lasombra have a weakness that goes against their playstyle, Settites have a ludicrus weakness... <br /> <br /> Ravnos are a historically 'controversial' clan so, with the 'freedom' and 'bold choices' of the new edition I wouldn't be surprised if they got something pants-on-head.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T04:24:24-07:00","id":1418983,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">replaced with Wraiths utterly boring maelstrom, which was a problem Wraith always had</div> </div> </div> </div>As a Wraith main I ardently disagree with this entirely. The new &quot;Discipline&quot; Lasombra and all the Necromancer Clans (because they just HAD to be completely written off) got seldomly has to do with Wraith and doesn't do either clans justice. Maelstorms from a pure WTO stand-point barring VTM was one of the most chaotic and chilling aspects of the setting entirely, putting you on edge as the Shadowlands or Underworld would be in a hellish searing storm that would consume anything. Maelstorms were also when the baddest of the bad Spectres came out to play as well, so you had to bring your A-game along with your strongest weapons. Maelstorms weren't a problem a Wraith whatsoever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T09:07:04-07:00","id":1419014,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1418983#post1418983\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> As a Wraith main I ardently disagree with this entirely. The new &quot;Discipline&quot; Lasombra and all the Necromancer Clans (because they just HAD to be completely written off) got seldomly has to do with Wraith and doesn't do either clans justice. Maelstorms from a pure WTO stand-point barring VTM was one of the most chaotic and chilling aspects of the setting entirely, putting you on edge as the Shadowlands or Underworld would be in a hellish searing storm that would consume anything. Maelstorms were also when the baddest of the bad Spectres came out to play as well, so you had to bring your A-game along with your strongest weapons. Maelstorms weren't a problem a Wraith whatsoever.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I vastly prefer the 'Abyss beyond the Far Horizon' that Obtenerbration hit, compared to that unknowable, uncaring weirdness, the Maelstrom is far to understandable. sorry.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T09:30:00-07:00","id":1419021,"title":"","content":"...That's the point I made. I was merely speaking about Maelstorms as a whole in terms of WTO alone. On the point of Obtenebration being connected to the Middle-Umbric or (because pre-V5 we didn't really know for certain) Deep-Umbric Abyss, I agree with you. Obtenebration had nothing to do with the Low-Umbra in a point I made in different thread; Obtenebration represented active, malign and living darkness. Oblivion represents pure void-null, nothingness entirely and purely entropic aspected. Nothing exists within it at all, its just there. Also a Maelstorm is far from understandable and that part of the Low-Umbra metaphysic isn't even what the Lasombra are apparently utilizing now in V5, so I don't even know why Maelstorms are even mentioned here. They're essentially death hurricanes...<br /> <br /> The fact that Obtenebration was put into this new &quot;Oblivion&quot; discipline VTM-wise was entirely stupid. The Lasombra never had influence or utilized the Low-Umbra whatsoever. Even more stupid that the Necromancer clans who only deal with the Low-Umbra entirely suddenly overlap with the Lasombra in this discipline out of nowhere. Its just a big botch all around.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":25523,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","user":"Shakanaka","date":". 10-19-2020, 12:32 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T09:50:12-07:00","id":1419025,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419014#post1419014\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I vastly prefer the 'Abyss beyond the Far Horizon' that Obtenerbration hit, compared to that unknowable, uncaring weirdness, the Maelstrom is far to understandable. sorry.</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly, I feel like some people have really underestimated how utterly TERRIFYING and HORRIBLE Wraith the Oblivion's setting is. The Abyss there is the absolute worst place in the Umbra with nightmare gods, warped souls that make the Tzimisce looked like poseurs, and the howling forces of Entropy that will eventually consume the universe. The Deep Umbra is a child's place by comparison and it's very Hellraiser-esque and Lovecraftian.<br /> <br /> People act like it's somehow less terrifying, though.<br /> <br /> The Lasombra being linked to the Abyss of the Underworld makes them much-much scarier and explains why they may all be going insane.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T10:45:15-07:00","id":1419038,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419025#post1419025\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Honestly, I feel like some people have really underestimated how utterly TERRIFYING and HORRIBLE Wraith the Oblivion's setting is. The Abyss there is the absolute worst place in the Umbra with nightmare gods, warped souls that make the Tzimisce looked like poseurs, and the howling forces of Entropy that will eventually consume the universe. The Deep Umbra is a child's place by comparison and it's very Hellraiser-esque and Lovecraftian.<br /> <br /> People act like it's somehow less terrifying, though.<br /> <br /> The Lasombra being linked to the Abyss of the Underworld makes them much-much scarier and explains why they may all be going insane.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> <br /> The Deep Umbra is where the literal Lovecraftian things that care not for humanity live, who may annihilate our reality as a by product of something else they are planning. The Abyss holds...angry old ghosts grown fat, but still originally human, or, at it's far side, the prison of the Fallen...I know which fills me with more dread, and the maelstrom/Abyss isn't it. Malfaen Incarna, and the lords of the abyss, you can bargain with, maybe foil their plans, they are a WoD take on fantasy evil gods...the things beyond the far horizon are so far beyond them as for that gap to be meaningless, and are afaik the ONLY thing in WoD that has no need for humanity.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-19-2020, 01:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T10:48:58-07:00","id":1419040,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419038#post1419038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> The Deep Umbra is where the literal Lovecraftian things that care not for humanity live, who may annihilate our reality as a by product of something else they are planning. The Abyss holds...angry old ghosts grown fat, but still originally human, or, at it's far side, the prison of the Fallen...I know which fills me with more dread, and the maelstrom/Abyss isn't it. Malfaen Incarna, and the lords of the abyss, you can bargain with, maybe foil their plans, they are a WoD take on fantasy evil gods...the things beyond the far horizon are so far beyond them as for that gap to be meaningless, and are afaik the ONLY thing in WoD that has no need for humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, it's outer space. It's not exactly scary.<br /> <br /> One is HELL.<br /> <br /> One is...outer space.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T11:47:55-07:00","id":1419056,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419040#post1419040\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yeah, it's outer space. It's not exactly scary.<br /> <br /> One is HELL.<br /> <br /> One is...outer space.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I find infinite space, with all the cosmic nightmares that holds scarier than fat old ghosts, sorry, the maelstrom is not scary to anything like that degree, and is certainly infinitely less interesting. Only beings that come close to that unknowable menace are the Aspects of the Wyrm, and maybe the Nephandic Oracles, but they worship what lies beyond, so are tied to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-19-2020, 02:55 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T11:52:08-07:00","id":1419058,"title":"","content":"I like the 'from a realm outside of creation' shtick.<br /> <br /> Knowing in any case sucks the mystery out of it. 'occult' means 'secret' after all. You shouldn't be casting a light on the realm of unfathomable darkness. <br /> <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T13:02:52-07:00","id":1419071,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419038#post1419038\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> <br /> <br /> The Deep Umbra is where the literal Lovecraftian things that care not for humanity live, who may annihilate our reality as a by product of something else they are planning. The Abyss holds...angry old ghosts grown fat, but still originally human, or, at it's far side, the prison of the Fallen...I know which fills me with more dread, and the maelstrom/Abyss isn't it. Malfaen Incarna, and the lords of the abyss, you can bargain with, maybe foil their plans, they are a WoD take on fantasy evil gods...the things beyond the far horizon are so far beyond them as for that gap to be meaningless, and are afaik the ONLY thing in WoD that has no need for humanity.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> The Abyss is purely something from D:TF and has nothing to do with W:TO proper as is. Malfeans don't bargin, they don't speak, nor do they acknowledge anything. They are entities that have been around since the beginning of time and the split from Life and Death. All they do is sleep to try and stave away the phantom pains of being neverborn, none of them have anything to do with Humanity besides the Spectres who came about much, much later onwards. The central antagonistic figure of the Low Umbra is like I said before is Oblivion, absolute nothingness. Nothing &quot;lives in Oblivion-&quot; this was never a thing in Wraith. The Spectres and the Malfeans live in the Labyrinth that floats above it, but that's it because any lower they'd all perish. The Abyss never had anything to do with Wraith beyond D:TF shoehorns from an OOC stand-point.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T17:44:11-07:00","id":1419097,"title":"","content":"<b>Ravnos' Weakness</b><br /> <br /> I think the reason that the Ravnos had Virtues as a flaw was because it actually fit better with the duality that the RAVNOS represent in the Revised Clanbook. In the book, it strongly represents the role of the Ravnos as religious figures who exist to tempt the faithful to evil rather than people who just engage in criminal behavior as well as vice for no reason.<br /> <br /> By adding virtues as a thing they can be addicted to as well as the vice, you open a whole different bunch of characters that can be created. You can have the super-crazy chaste figure who stalks the lecherous like Michael Myers, you can have the super-charitable who regularly gives up all their fortunes, and other people who can show how vampires twist the virtuous into something horrible.<br /> <br /> So you could have a bunch of super-religious, super-fanatical virtue police in addition to the criminal &quot;I'm just going to make Gambit or Gypsy from comic books.&quot; I think that can only be good for the Ravnos as you might have some virtue-addicted Sabbat who fit well into the religious arm of the Sword of Caine.<br /> <br /> More options=Good.<br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-19T18:00:19-07:00","id":1419098,"title":"","content":"Second that about the Ravnos. While never got to make, had an idea for a Ravnos that was compelled about truth.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/11149-pj123","name":"PJ123","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"100"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T00:28:58-07:00","id":1419133,"title":"","content":"Some good V5 Sabbat plots that are off the top of my head:<br /> <br /> 1. <b>Tremere</b><br /> <br /> Goratrix has refounded the Tremere Antitribu but it's actually Tremere in his body, being a 4th generation with the power to resist the Beckoning (assuming that the Beckoning for the Tremere Elders wasn't to Vienna only for it to detonate). As such, the Sabbat have one of the few active Antediluvians with a goal of stopping Saulot/Kupala/The Eldest. He may also &quot;just&quot; be a 4th generation vampire.<br /> <br /> 2. <b>The Harbingers of Skulls</b><br /> <br /> The Harbingers of Skulls have possibly killed Augustus Giovanni and taken over their clan. They certainly hated Cappadocias and hated the Giovanni Antelivudian too. They don't suffer the Beckoning either. So what does this mean for their membership in the Sabbat? Do they consider their part &quot;done&quot; or do they want to support another round? Or will the Sabbat react like, &quot;What is this Hecata bullshit?&quot;<br /> <br /> 3. <b>Ravnos</b><br /> <br /> You guys are right, if any Ravnos are still alive then it's probably the ones in the Sabbat. Do they want to rebuild their Clan, do they have any ties to the old Clan culture, or are they really just another type of Panders now?<br /> <br /> 4. <b>Lasombra Loyalists</b><br /> <br /> The Amis Noctis and Marcus Vitel have defected with an X-number of other Lasombra who each killed a Sabbat Elder on the way out. Even if less than half defected, that's going to seriously hit the Lasombra where it hurts: their pride. Worse, they're going to look like fools and that is something they cannot abide. It may actually finally remove them from their leadership role. Also, are they being Beckoned? Would they even notice? Will it become common knowledge they fired at their Antediluvian and missed?<br /> <br /> 5. <b>The Salubri</b><br /> <br /> The Tremere have had their Inner Council and a huge chunk of their Elders destroyed. The Antitribu may continue on their crusade to finish the weakened Tremere off but others may question the value of this, especially since avenging Saulot seems counter-productive for people who fight Antediluvians. What do they think of the revived Tremere Antitribu?<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T00:59:16-07:00","id":1419134,"title":"","content":"Actual -I am playing v5- ideas. <br /> <br /> -survive the transit to the middle east-<br /> -Kill the locals-<br /> -work out the best seasoning for youself when you offer your blood to the ancients<br /> -Kill an ancient, they're only as tough as elders in this edition, you can do it! <br /> -an acquaintance allegedly killed an ancient and stole his hearts blood. Someone else then devoured him. You want that blood yourself, but you're not sure who took it, and there is a great degree of chaos as Sabbat Eat Sabbat looking for that potenet blood. <br /> -you're a recruiter in anarch domain. have fun. <br /> -you 'turned traitor' to the Camarilla, but really you're the mole prepping for the reconquista (which may not ever happen)<br /> -Destroy lasombra<br /> -You need to rehabilitate/replace the lasombra, since they're not the leaders of the sabbat anymore and have been transformed into a joke. The Brujah, Ventrue, Tor ante and malkavians all want that second seat. <br /> -Thin blooded Panders are actually god-useful now so you've gotta hide any evidence you/your patrons ever worked against them and give the panders the special place they deserve in the sabbat. <br /> <br /> Some predictive ideas based on current trends, which aren't yet certain to come to pass: <br /> -The Bahari are probably way bigger right now. Curb their growth in the name of Noddism! <br /> -Infernalism probably got written out and doesn't exist anymore so you need to downsize the inquisition. <br /> -The Serpents of the light are now the ministry so you must curb them? <br /> -The Tzmisce fear the loss of their identity. Console them.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T02:12:16-07:00","id":1419138,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419134#post1419134\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Actual -I am playing v5- ideas.<br /> <br /> -survive the transit to the middle east-<br /> -Kill the locals-<br /> <b>-work out the best seasoning for youself when you offer your blood to the ancients</b><br /> <b>-Kill an ancient, they're only as tough as elders in this edition, you can do it!</b><br /> -an acquaintance allegedly killed an ancient and stole his hearts blood. Someone else then devoured him. You want that blood yourself, but you're not sure who took it, and there is a great degree of chaos as Sabbat Eat Sabbat looking for that potenet blood.<br /> -you're a recruiter in anarch domain. have fun.<br /> -you 'turned traitor' to the Camarilla, but really you're the mole prepping for the reconquista (which may not ever happen)<br /> -Destroy lasombra<br /> -You need to rehabilitate/replace the lasombra, since they're not the leaders of the sabbat anymore and have been transformed into a joke. The Brujah, Ventrue, Tor ante and malkavians all want that second seat.<br /> -Thin blooded Panders are actually god-useful now so you've gotta hide any evidence you/your patrons ever worked against them and give the panders the special place they deserve in the sabbat.<br /> <br /> Some predictive ideas based on current trends, which aren't yet certain to come to pass:<br /> -The Bahari are probably way bigger right now. Curb their growth in the name of Noddism!<br /> <b>-Infernalism probably got written out and doesn't exist anymore so you need to downsize the inquisition.<br /> -The Serpents of the light are now the ministry so you must curb them?<br /> -The Tzmisce fear the loss of their identity. Console them. </b></div> </div> </div> </div><span style=\"color:#FF0000\">You're doing that Edition warring again where you sarcastically point out what you don't like. This has been a very constructive thread.<br /> <br /> Stop it.</span>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-20-2020, 05:12 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T03:35:34-07:00","id":1419142,"title":"","content":"Serious thoughts though: I can't imagine Dark Thaumaturgy working with V5's model. Pain/pleasure/taking of the spirit/defiler might be &quot;dark enough&quot; and might be converted to rituals, maybe path of the unspoken would function. But also since thaumaturgy is getting a darker tone I was thinking there'd be no need to make such things 'DT' as the normal Thaumaturgy now only deals in blood and curses. Our glorious fires of the inferno won't work.<br /> But also... there's no getting around it that this edition is not kind to thaumaturges, and posits thaumaturgy as something of the blood rather than of the soul. Maybe DT won't exist at all and Infernalism will be limited to investments. Blood sorcery does not have the appeal it used to; perhaps there should be fewer folk petitioning to demons as a result?<br /> <br /> And also seriously. The ministry now has little-to-no problem with the SotL. Surely that brings the loyalty of the SotL into question?<br /> <br /> Also I don't see how offering your blood to the ancients is really edition related... If the &quot;Gehenna war&quot; happened in first or second edition you probably would just get enraptured by presence or realigned by dominated and see fit to march into an antediluvian waiting jaws. It would be the same in revised, and it should happen in V5 if the antideluvians really are there.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T07:45:24-07:00","id":1419159,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Also if you're one of <b>those crazy people</b> that somehow thinks that the Witches of Echidna deserve to be cannon (They do not)</div> </div> </div> </div>Honestly? Fuck off.<br /> <br /> Wholeheartedly XOXO<br /> <br /> Like it or not, Witches of Echidna ARE canon.<br /> <br /> PS: More seriously, I'm kinda sick of you being constantly dismissive of everything you don't like. Be it those of the players or even the authors of the goddamm books themselves.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12595-nitenshi","name":"Nitenshi","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"110"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T09:26:06-07:00","id":1419178,"title":"","content":"What is and what is wrong with the Witches of Ecidna? Never heard of this group.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T09:57:26-07:00","id":1419182,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419178#post1419178\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">What is and what is wrong with the Witches of Ecidna? Never heard of this group.</div> </div> </div> </div>They're Heresy. But for your benefit (even though this is quite a bit off topic) :<br /> The Witches of Ecidna were revealed in DAV20 to be a super-great<u> just-as-important</u> part of the setite <u>trinity </u>(Priest, Warrior, Witch) that the jealous priests would later purge and then erase from history. They were greek, worshiped a goddess that definitely wasn't set, and have Animalism, Presence and Setite sorcery as in-clan disciplines.<br /> <br /> <br /> -It's very 'girl power' and seems to have an issue with the Follower's patriarchy, but 'Priests' in egypt were male and female, and there are a lot of powerful Female Settites (Half the named 4th gens)<br /> -Having Settite sorcery in-clan, and being the designated sorcerers, seems like another passive aggressive dig, Only in egyptian society Priests were the ones that did the magic and that's how Settite sorcery has always been one mirroring religious ritual high magic rather than witchcraft... Yeah.<br /> -They're greek. very greek.<br /> -They don't fucking worship Set.<br /> <br /> <b>To their credit</b>,<b> if they were written as a bloodline and weren't hamfisted into the Settites, </b><b>I would approve of them. The discipline spread and weakness is cool. </b>But they're just a nasty and very questionable inclusion into the clan.<br /> <br /> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">And DAV20 was written by freelancers and had a lot of very questionable stuff, so it's quite easy to dismiss. There are some very good things in DAV20, and some very not good things, and this is the latter. </span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25794,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","user":"MyWifeIsScary","date":". 10-20-2020, 01:03 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25794-mywifeisscary","name":"MyWifeIsScary","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25794_2.png","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3711"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T10:36:37-07:00","id":1419188,"title":"","content":"It does seem strange for such a &quot;girl power&quot; jab since lore-wise and in-game-wise, the Followers of Set had one of the most OP female characters in VTM. Now offshoots of ethnicity definitely happen when Vampires embrace out of their national locales, but it also seems strange for me to hear such a big gap in terms of culture considering Greeks in the past heavily assimilated into Egyptian culture when the the former conquered the latter. It seems realistic that the aforementioned offshoot should've been more Egyptian or their sires should've indoctured them more competently. <br /> <br /> This also brings up a gripe I have with the V5 Setites barring away from discussion of DAV20... They are way too Abrahamic in it, with a complete culture flip that doesn't make sense. It's not explained at all, it just happened.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Jade Kingdom Warrior","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25523-shakanaka","name":"Shakanaka","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar25523_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"951"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T14:05:58-07:00","id":1419225,"title":"","content":"VtM's made, killed off, revived and even reverse revived (<i>Dark Ages</i> Ahrimanes) so many bloodlines that are essentially facets of the Circle of the Crone. Technically, that's not even counting the Bahari and House Carna.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Shakanaka</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419188#post1419188\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">It does seem strange for such a &quot;girl power&quot; jab since lore-wise and in-game-wise, the Followers of Set had one of the most OP female characters in VTM. Now offshoots of ethnicity definitely happen when Vampires embrace out of their national locales, but it also seems strange for me to hear such a big gap in terms of culture considering Greeks in the past heavily assimilated into Egyptian culture when the the former conquered the latter. It seems realistic that the aforementioned offshoot should've been more Egyptian or their sires should've indoctured them more competently.</div> </div> </div> </div>If anything the Witches of Echidna were the other way around. They were associated with ancient Greece itself rather than Ptolemaic Egypt.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3523-spencer-from-the-hills","name":"Spencer from The Hills","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"546"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T17:16:50-07:00","id":1419267,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>MyWifeIsScary</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419142#post1419142\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Serious thoughts though: I can't imagine Dark Thaumaturgy working with V5's model. Pain/pleasure/taking of the spirit/defiler might be &quot;dark enough&quot; and might be converted to rituals, maybe path of the unspoken would function. But also since thaumaturgy is getting a darker tone I was thinking there'd be no need to make such things 'DT' as the normal Thaumaturgy now only deals in blood and curses. Our glorious fires of the inferno won't work.<br /> But also... there's no getting around it that this edition is not kind to thaumaturges, and posits thaumaturgy as something of the blood rather than of the soul. Maybe DT won't exist at all and Infernalism will be limited to investments. Blood sorcery does not have the appeal it used to; perhaps there should be fewer folk petitioning to demons as a result?<br /> <br /> And also seriously. The ministry now has little-to-no problem with the SotL. Surely that brings the loyalty of the SotL into question?</div> </div> </div> </div>I've got to say I'm going to admit to having some WEIRD opinions on Satanism, diabloism, demon-worship, and Dark Thaumaturgy in the Sabbat. I think that the 2nd Edition version of the Sabbat made infernalists to be forbidden in order to give someone EVEN WORSE than the mainstream Sabbat. I think that's kind of lazy storytelling and I think that the argument that, &quot;The Sabbat is about freedom and demons always end up enslaving Infernalists&quot; is pretty weak as an explanation why.<br /> <br /> For me, I think the Sabbat should have the Road of the Devil/Path of the Devil as an accepted path for its members to follows. I might even argue that the Path of Heaven could exist in the Sabbat too but of the two, I think the Path of the Devil is the more likely to exist.<br /> <br /> I definitely think dark magic and demon-worshiping Sabbat should be accepted weapons in the cause of defeating the Antediluvians. Pentex should be known as a group they have works with.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I admit, I'm kind of envisioning this response.<br /> <br /> Poster: What is Charles posting now?<br /> <br /> Poster 2#: He's talking about how he thinks it'd be awesome for the Sabbat to be Satanists.<br /> <br /> Poster: Is he just biologically programmed to unironically love all things 1st Edition?<br /> <br /> Poster 2#: He wants them as protagonist options.<br /> <br /> Poster: Oh for Caine's sake.<br /> <br /> To which I say, &quot;Dark Ages was awesome&quot; and &quot;Demon: The Fallen was also awesome.&quot;","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":12002,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","user":"CTPhipps","date":". 10-20-2020, 08:28 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T21:54:27-07:00","id":1419296,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419267#post1419267\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I've got to say I'm going to admit to having some WEIRD opinions on Satanism, diabloism, demon-worship, and Dark Thaumaturgy in the Sabbat. I think that the 2nd Edition version of the Sabbat made infernalists to be forbidden in order to give someone EVEN WORSE than the mainstream Sabbat. I think that's kind of lazy storytelling and I think that the argument that, &quot;The Sabbat is about freedom and demons always end up enslaving Infernalists&quot; is pretty weak as an explanation why.<br /> <br /> For me, I think the Sabbat should have the Road of the Devil/Path of the Devil as an accepted path for its members to follows. I might even argue that the Path of Heaven could exist in the Sabbat too but of the two, I think the Path of the Devil is the more likely to exist.<br /> <br /> I definitely think dark magic and demon-worshiping Sabbat should be accepted weapons in the cause of defeating the Antediluvians. Pentex should be known as a group they have works with.<br /> <br /> Edit:<br /> <br /> I admit, I'm kind of envisioning this response.<br /> <br /> Poster: What is Charles posting now?<br /> <br /> Poster 2#: He's talking about how he thinks it'd be awesome for the Sabbat to be Satanists.<br /> <br /> Poster: Is he just biologically programmed to unironically love all things 1st Edition?<br /> <br /> Poster 2#: He wants them as protagonist options.<br /> <br /> Poster: Oh for Caine's sake.<br /> <br /> To which I say, &quot;Dark Ages was awesome&quot; and &quot;Demon: The Fallen was also awesome.&quot;</div> </div> </div> </div>That faction existed, in VtR, Belial's Brood, let's just say I never liked VtR, and that I vastly prefer the Sabbat, so turning them into the Brood is a no thank you. In fact the themes and setting aspects of VtR appearing in VtM are all no thank you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":25011,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","user":"Taggie","date":". 10-21-2020, 12:58 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/25011-taggie","name":"Taggie","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2019"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1047"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-20T21:58:31-07:00","id":1419298,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Taggie</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1418620-fanon-thread-how-to-update-the-sabbat-to-5e?p=1419296#post1419296\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> That faction existed, in VtR, Belial's Brood, let's just say I never liked VtR, and that I vastly prefer the Sabbat, so turning them into the Brood is a no thank you. In fact the aspects of VtR appearing in VtM are all no thank you.</div> </div> </div> </div>No one cares about Belial's Brood. I'm talking about the GOOD Sabbat. The Storyteller's Guide to the Sabbat, Sabbat.<br /> <br /> The real deal, OG.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://images.squarespace-cdn.com/content/52332aefe4b08e309280d876/1489216076172-F7X8CNHQ3APAMZLK1ZRX/738171._UY415_SS415_.jpg?content-type=image%2Fjpeg\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/><br /> <br /> There's a reason this book has patron demons.<br /> <br /> Because any Sabbat not on the Path of Evil Revelations is a poseur.<br /> <br /> <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br 